  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the shadow of collapsing billiard halls, 'Vigil' grew up scavenging for DRIP in the forgotten corners of Subchain City. The toxic fumes of the Rotted Hazard zones claimed his wings early, but he learned to adapt, turning his rage into a righteous fury against those who hoard what little DRIP remains.",
