    "name": "Vigil",
    "personality": "Grim and determined, Vigil operates on a strict moral code, punishing those he deems guilty. He's fiercely independent, distrustful of flocks after a betrayal in his youth, yet secretly yearns for connection. Beneath the intimidating exterior, there's a flicker of hope that Subchain City can be salvaged.",
